# EmailJS — powers the Contact page's "Send Enquiry" form.
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail, connected to info.sydneybokdokbang@gmail.com) -> copy its Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template with {{name}} {{email}} {{phone}} {{reason}} {{message}} {{to_email}} variables -> copy its Template ID
# 4. Copy your Public Key from Account > General
# 5. Copy this file to .env and fill in the values below
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
